{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:40:59+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:40:59+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Howden Joinery Group Plc","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Furnishings, Fixtures & Appliances","country":"United Kingdom","city":"London","website":"https://www.howdenjoinerygroupplc.com","employees":12000,"summary":"Howden Joinery Group Plc supplies various kitchen, joinery, and hardware products in the United Kingdom, France, Belgium, and the Republic of Ireland. The company's product portfolio includes cabinet, worktops, sinks and taps, flooring, appliances, and handles; internal and external doors, such as fire doors, flooring, stair parts, and general joinery items; and cooking, cleaning, and cooling appliances. The company was formerly known as Galiform Plc and changed its name to Howden Joinery Group Plc in September 2010. Howden Joinery Group Plc was incorporated in 1987 and is based in London, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Howden Joinery Group Plc fournit divers produits de cuisine, de menuiserie et de quincaillerie au Royaume-Uni, en France, en Belgique et en République d'Irlande. Le portefeuille de produits de la société comprend des armoires, des plans de travail, des éviers et des robinets, des revêtements de sol, des appareils électroménagers et des poignées; des portes intérieures et extérieures, telles que des portes coupe-feu, des revêtements de sol, des escaliers et des articles de menuiserie généraux; et des appareils de cuisson, de nettoyage et de refroidissement. La société était auparavant connue sous le nom de Galiform Plc et a changé son nom pour Howden Joinery Group Plc en septembre 2010."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":4365690368,"shares_outstanding":541985139,"trailing_pe":16.781252,"forward_pe":14.300171,"price_to_book":382.8422,"ev_to_ebit